        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThere are explicit mentions that the fallback completion uses built-in Insert mode completion, so any performance enhancements are delegated to consulting the built-in help.\n\nThe mention about the `t` flag is there because it is automatically removed (as it caused *very* visible lags), but I guess adding the suggestion for the whole `'complete'` value (`'.,w,b,kspell'`, as is set in MiniMax) is a good idea here.",
